Z||000011||88 Fiero||12-08-1999||06:44 PM||||If you guys are going to buy this F355 nose...buy it from the Florida Fiero Club... I talk to the owner of this nose...Joe Nierost...he said that his F355 nose is the second generation that he had his fiberglass guy build...on the other hand PISA got the first generation of this same nose...Joe told his fiberglass guy not to sell his second generation because they modified the nose again so it will look better...and PISA got stuck with the first design...||||reg||1
